換算，未知端點不由卒日、逃亡、首次用稱或復位推造。御為來源任事用語，制度種類仍須另核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji043-010","person_id":"cbr-p002239","surfaces":["造父"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-043-zhao"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p003","quote":"孟增幸於周成王，是爲宅皋狼。皋狼生衡父，衡父生造父。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p004","quote":"造父幸於周繆王。造父取驥之乘匹，與桃林盜驪、驊騮、緑耳，獻之繆王。繆王使造父御，西巡狩，見西王母，樂之忘歸。而徐偃王反，繆王日馳千里馬，攻徐偃王，大破之。乃賜造父以趙城，由此爲趙氏。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p005","quote":"自造父已下六世至奄父，曰公仲，周宣王時伐戎，爲御。及千畝戰，奄父脱宣王。奄父生叔帶。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p122","quote":"趙氏之系，與秦同祖。周穆平徐，乃封造父。帶始事晉，夙初有土。岸賈矯誅，韓厥立武。寶符臨代，卒居伯魯。簡夢翟犬，靈歌處女。胡服雖強，建立非所。頗、牧不用，王遷囚虜。"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示名字、是為與連續事件暫接異稱；真孤與替代兒分開，馬匹、群體與闕代不當個人，不以模型記憶補熟知姓名。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:p003","text":"孟增幸於周成王，是爲宅皋狼。皋狼生衡父，衡父生造父。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m003-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"孟增","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002236","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m003-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"周成王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002237","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m003-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"宅皋狼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002236","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m003-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"皋狼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002236","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m003-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"衡父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002238","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m003-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"衡父","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002238","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-043-zhao:m003-0023","start":23,"end":25,"su